---
title: Grafana
endpoints:
  - name: Grafana
    url: http://localhost:30300
  - name: Grafana (route)
    url: http://grafana.gck.local
    note: after a one-time "gck setup dns"
    when: '{{ hasFlag "enable-route" }}'
---
Grafana, Tempo and the collector share the `observability` namespace, leaving the
product namespace to the product.

Browse anonymously, or sign in as admin / admin. The Tempo datasource is already
provisioned, and the collector forwards traces to Tempo. Open Explore to search
them:

  open http://localhost:30300/explore
